capability statsd/client  a StatsD or DogStatsD client over UDP, with a prefix and tags on every line
  heroes  metrics.open_statsd, metrics.close_statsd, metrics.Statsd
  go      statsd.New, statsd.NewWithWriter, statsd.Client, statsd.Client.Close, statsd.ClientInterface, statsd.CloneWithExtraOptions, statsd.WithNamespace, statsd.WithTags, statsd.Option, statsd.Options, statsd.NoOpClient, statsd.Client.IsClosed
